users/spadgos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-04-18T11:21:32Z","updated_at":"2014-04-18T11:21:32Z","body":"Unfortunately, this didn't entirely solve the problem. It appears to work properly for the strict rule, but not others. Here's some different content in two files, and the errors they report (again, in a clean dir, eslint 0.5.1, running `eslint .`):\n\nFirstly, just the default rules.\n\n``` js\n// bar.js\nfunction bar() { var b = '1'; }\n\n// foo.js\nfunction foo() { var f = '1'; }\n\n/*\nbar.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:0   error  Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n  1:21  error  b is defined but never used     no-unused-vars\n\nfoo.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:0   error  Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n  1:21  error  f is defined but never used     no-unused-vars\n*/\n```\n\nSo far so good. Remove the strict warning in `bar.js`\n\n``` js\n// bar.js\n/*eslint strict: 0*/\nfunction bar() { var b = '1'; }\n\n// foo.js\nfunction foo() { var f = '1'; }\n\n/*\nbar.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:21  error  b is defined but never used     no-unused-vars\n\nfoo.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:0   error  Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n  1:21  error  f is defined but never used     no-unused-vars\n*/\n```\n\nStill good. Remove the no-unused-vars warning in `bar.js`\n\n``` js\n// bar.js\n/*eslint strict:0, no-unused-vars:0*/\nfunction bar() { var b = '1'; }\n\n// foo.js\nfunction foo() { var f = '1'; }\n\n/*\nbar.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n\nfoo.js\n  1:25  error  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:0   error  Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n*/\n```\n\nWe lost the warning about unused `f` in the second file. /sadface\n\n``` js\n// bar.js\n/*eslint strict:0, no-unused-vars:0, quotes:0 */\nfunction bar() { var b = '1'; }\n\n// foo.js\nfunction foo() { var f = '1'; }\n\n/*\nfoo.js\n  1:0   error  Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n*/\n```\n\nLost the quotes warning in the second file. Let's move the comments into `foo.js` which is checked second:\n\n``` js\n// bar.js\nfunction bar() { var b = '1'; }\n\n// foo.js\n/*eslint strict: 0, no-unused-vars:0, quotes:0 */\nfunction foo() { var f = '1'; }\n\n/*\nbar.js\n  1:25  warning  Strings must use doublequote    quotes\n  1:0   error    Missing \"use strict\" statement  strict\n  1:21  warning  b is defined but never used     no-unused-vars\n*/\n```\n\nThe errors have been turned to warnings for `bar.js`\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/40802525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"spadgos","id":426222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/426222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos","html_url":"https://github.com/spadgos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spadgos/events{/privacy